SUMMARY:Nomination deadline: KNAW Early Career Award 2027
DESCRIPTION:KNAW. KNAW Early Career Award: up to 12 awards of €15\,000 e
 ach (max 3 per Academy domain) for researchers 3-7 years post-PhD who do 
 not yet hold an associate/full professor position. Recognises innovative 
 contributions to science and scientific practice. Nominations open until 
 1 July 2026. Ceremony December 2026 at Trippenhuis\, Amsterdam. Contribut
 ions may relate to Recognition & Rewards themes: research\, education\, i
 mpact\, patient care\, leadership.\n\nhttps://www.knaw.nl/en/science-fund
 s/knaw-early-career-award
URL:https://www.knaw.nl/en/science-funds/knaw-early-career-award
