SUMMARY:Application deadline: ERC Advanced Grant 2027
DESCRIPTION:ERC. ERC Work Programme 2027 (adopted). For established resear
 ch leaders with a significant track record. Call opens 27 May 2027\; dead
 line 26 August 2027. Up to €2.5M for 5 years (plus up to €1M addition
 al\, incl. Choose Europe relocation top-up). Bottom-up: any research topi
 c. Budget ~€798M\, ~311 grants expected. Successor to the 2026 round (I
 D 25).\n\nhttps://erc.europa.eu/apply-grant/advanced-grant
URL:https://erc.europa.eu/apply-grant/advanced-grant
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
