SUMMARY:Full proposal deadline: HORIZON-HLTH-2027-03-TOOL-04 – Virtual H
 uman Twins for Clinical Decision Support in Prevention and Diagnosis
DESCRIPTION:Horizon Europe. Research and Innovation Action to build and cl
 inically validate multi-scale\, patient-specific Virtual Human Twin model
 s that support prevention and diagnosis\, including health-economic or co
 st-effectiveness evidence from real-world settings and plans for regulato
 ry compliance (MDR/IVDR\, AI Act). Expected EU contribution is €10–12
  million per project (about 4 projects). The single-stage call opens 3 Ju
 ne 2027 and closes 16 September 2027.\n\nhttps://cordis.europa.eu/program
 me/id/HORIZON_HORIZON-HLTH-2027-03-TOOL-04
URL:https://cordis.europa.eu/programme/id/HORIZON_HORIZON-HLTH-2027-03-TOO
 L-04
